<title>USA: Easco sees Q4 loss, including charges.</title>
<headline>Easco sees Q4 loss, including charges.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easco Inc said on Wednesday it expected to report a loss for the fourth quarter, including special charges related to incentive compensation and severance payments.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said the charges were related to a management realignment.</p>
